This repository holds facts only: the number, title and date of assent of Acts of Jamaica, as listed in the "Report on Acts passed in
Parliament" PDFs of the Houses of Parliament of Jamaica (https://www.japarliament.gov.jm/). Facts are not protected by copyright. No
text of any Act, and none of the reports' descriptive wording, is copied.

Treaty actions (treaty name, action, date, depositary) come from the UN Treaty Collection, https://treaties.un.org/, as facts only. For 2016-2022, the number, title and PDF link of each Act come from the yearly 'Acts Passed' lists of the same Houses of Parliament, retrieved 30 October 2026.

The WIPO catalogue entries and wipo-treaties facts (titles, subjects, dates, administering organisation, links) come from WIPO Lex, https://www.wipo.int/wipolex/, retrieved 30 October 2026, whose content is published under CC BY 4.0 (https://www.wipo.int/web/terms-of-use). Only facts are copied. Source: World Intellectual Property Organization. Changes made by Lexifina: records were turned into one Markdown file per record, with the dates arranged as a git history. WIPO does not endorse this repository.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice
and not an official publication.
